WEBVTT

00:10:56.777 --> 00:11:00.280
they help care for and monitor
the largest nickel mine in the world

00:11:00.322 --> 00:11:02.700
at Voisey's Bay in Labrador.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:05.786
Guardians help ensure
that when development occurs,

00:11:05.828 --> 00:11:09.832
it happens with the informed
consent of our nations.

00:11:10.207 --> 00:11:14.920
That projects do not have an adverse
effect on our rights and titles.

00:11:15.337 --> 00:11:19.633
And that our nations and communities
can benefit or maximize those benefits

00:11:19.633 --> 00:11:21.510
from those development activities.

00:11:22.511 --> 00:11:26.432
Whether they are monitoring
the largest nickel mine in the world

00:11:26.473 --> 00:11:29.476
or sustaining giant carbon storehouses,

00:11:29.518 --> 00:11:33.981
guardians are helping honor
our responsibility to the land.